{"id":"n87077-4-3","stage":4,"title":"환히 · 清秀地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87077-4-3-1","ko":"내 아들이라서 그런지 참 잘생겼단 말이야.","zh":"因为是自己的儿子，长得可真帅啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"아들이라서","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아들이라서","audio":"/audio/d705e2614bdea0c1d53f.mp3"}},{"text":"그런지","meaning":"那样，一般","explanation":"그렇다：那样，一般；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"5","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런지","audio":"/audio/704d00595d8d6a229772.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"잘생겼단","meaning":"好看，漂亮，英俊","explanation":"잘생기다：好看，漂亮，英俊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"잘생기다","audio":"/audio/c56f4bd1fb4139c5b3d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24881","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘생겼단","audio":"/audio/ac7f5affc86eccf0ba93.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"ter